react-native-nitro-refresh

This package references the Apache-2.0 implementations:
react-native-SmartRefreshLayout, react-native-studio
https://github.com/react-native-studio/react-native-SmartRefreshLayout
react-native-MJRefresh, react-native-studio
https://github.com/react-native-studio/react-native-MJRefresh

The original integration referenced their Android gesture and iOS Header lifecycle hooks.
The current refresh containers use Android and UIKit APIs directly and do not depend on or embed SmartRefreshLayout or MJRefresh engines.
